    "title_en": "Hitchin's $α$-invariant and positive sectional curvature on homotopy $9$-spheres",
    "abstract_en": "We prove that a smooth homotopy $9$-sphere admits a Riemannian metric of positive sectional curvature if and only if its Hitchin $α$-invariant vanishes, or equivalently if and only if it admits a Riemannian metric of positive scalar curvature.",
